  "solution": {
    "text": "For \\(n=1\\), we have;\n\\(x^{n+1}+(x+1)^{2 n-1}=x^2+(x+1)=x^2+x+1 \\text {, }\\)\nwhich is divisible by \\(x^2+x+1\\)\nFor \\(n=2\\), we have; \\(x^{n+1}+(x+1)^{2 n-1}\\)\n\\(=x^3+(x+1)^3=(2 x+1)\\left(x^2+x+1\\right) \\text {, }\\)\nwhich is divisible by \\(x^2+x+1\\).",
    "image": null
